

<frame frame_id="wide_establishing_tree">FADE IN:

EXT. FAMILYHOUSE_EXTERIOR_TREE - DAY

Wide establishing shot of FAMILYHOUSE_EXTERIOR_TREE, the friendly shade tree foregrounded with the cottage far behind. PANDA and GLAUX are playing with a red ball in front of the tree.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="panda_throws_ball" reference_frame="wide_establishing_tree">CAMERA: Two-shot, medium, GLAUX and PANDA facing each other with the ball between them.

PANDA
ἐγώ νῦν βάλλω τὴν σφαῖραν, ὦ Γλαῦξ.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="glaux_catches_ball" reference_frame="panda_throws_ball">
CAMERA: Close on the ball as it arcs gently; then pan to GLAUX catching.

GLAUX
ἐγώ λαμβάνω τὴν σφαῖραν.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="lukos_enters_vo" reference_frame="glaux_catches_ball">
CAMERA: Pan right to reveal LUKOS stepping into frame; shift to a 1-shot with only LUKOS.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Λύκος νῦν προσέρχεται πρὸς τὸ δένδρον.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="lukos_threatens" reference_frame="lukos_enters_vo">
LUKOS
ἐγώ νῦν βούλομαι ὑμᾶς ἐσθίειν.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="panda_afraid">
CAMERA: Tight two-shot on GLAUX and PANDA, showing their scared reaction.

PANDA
οἰμοι! ἐγώ φοβοῦμαι!
</frame>

<frame frame_id="glaux_calls_for_help" reference_frame="panda_afraid">
GLAUX
ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος, βοήθει ἡμῖν.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="hyperbrephos_blocks_play">CUT TO:

INT. FAMILYHOUSE_INTERIOR_BEDROOM - DAY

Closup shot of HYPERBREPHOS sitting in the room playing with a set of 5-10 small blocks. He is building a tower, which is almost as big as he is. HYPERBREPHOS is happy and carefree, unaware that his friends are in trouble.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="hyperbrephos_hears_and_runs" reference_frame="hyperbrephos_blocks_play">HYPERBREPHOS smashes the tower. We see the blocks fly away with cartoonish speed and effects because HYPERBREPHOS is so strong!
</frame>

<frame frame_id="frame_1766008146738" reference_frame="hyperbrephos_hears_and_runs">HYPERBREPHOS hears GLAUX calling in the distance and gets a concerned look on his face.

GLAUX
ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος, βοήθει ἡμῖν.
ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος, βοήθει ἡμῖν.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="didaskalos_hyperbrephos_hears_runs_vo" reference_frame="frame_1766008146738">HYPERBREPHOS dashes out of the room with cartoon super speed.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Ὑπερβρέφος ἀκούει τὴν φωνὴν καὶ τρέχει ἐκ τῆς οἰκίας.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="hyperbrephos_throws_rock_vo">CUT TO:

EXT. FAMILYHOUSE_EXTERIOR_TREE - DAY (CONTINUOUS)

CAMERA: Tracking shot arrives with HYPERBREPHOS into the action; reframe to a wide that includes all four characters.

GLAUX:
ἰδοὺ! ὁ ὑπερβρέφος ἔρχεται!
</frame>

<frame frame_id="frame_1766008380694" reference_frame="hyperbrephos_throws_rock_vo">DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Ὑπερβρέφος λαμβάνει τὸν λίθον καὶ βάλλει τὸν λίθον πρὸς τὸν Λύκον.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="lukos_hit_cartoon_stars" reference_frame="frame_1766008380694">We see cartoon stars circle LUKOS's head where the rock hit him. 

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ λίθος τύπτει κατὰ τοῦ λύκου.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="frame_1766008525880" reference_frame="hyperbrephos_throws_rock_vo">LUKOS becomes paralized like a cartoon plank and falls backwards to the ground with a thud.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ λύκος καταπίπτει εἰς τὴν γῆν
</frame>

<frame frame_id="hyperbrephos_warns_lukos" reference_frame="frame_1766008525880">
CAMERA: Close-up on HYPERBREPHOS as he wags his finger in a gesture of no.

HYPERBREPHOS
ὦ Λύκε, μὴ φάγῃς τοὺς φίλους ἐμοὺς.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="lukos_apologizes" reference_frame="hyperbrephos_warns_lukos">
CAMERA: Medium close-up on LUKOS. He has a throbbing large cartoon bump on his head where the ball hit him. He is slowly getting to his feet.

LUKOS
συγγνώμη. ἐγώ ἀπέρχομαι νῦν.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="didaskalos_lukos_flees_vo" reference_frame="lukos_apologizes">
CAMERA: Close up on LUKOS as he backs away; slowly at first but then with frantic cartoon cartoon speed because he is so scared.

DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
ὁ Λύκος φεύγει ἀπὸ τοῦ δένδρου.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="panda_thanks_hyperbrephos" reference_frame="didaskalos_lukos_flees_vo">
CAMERA: Medium two-shot on PANDA and HYPERBREPHOS, GLAUX entering the edge of frame with the ball.

PANDA
εὐχαριστῶ σοι, ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="glaux_invites_play" reference_frame="panda_thanks_hyperbrephos">
CAMERA: Reset to a comfortable wide; GLAUX and PANDA resume their spacing.

GLAUX
παῖζε μεθ' ἡμῶν, ὦ Ὑπερβρέφος.
</frame>

<frame frame_id="didaskalos_animals_play_again_vo">DIDASKALOS (V.O.)
τὰ καλὰ ζῷα παίζει μετὰ τοῦ Ὑπερβρέφους τῇ σφαίρᾳ.
χαίρουσι πάλιν.
</frame>

